# Context

Living picture. Update in the same change as a new actor or external system.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  {% if kind == 'service' %}
  user[User]
  {% if frontend == 'vite' %}
  web[frontend SPA]
  api["{{ project_name }} API"]
  user --> web
  web -->|"HTTP /api"| api
  {% else %}
  api["{{ project_name }} HTTP"]
  user --> api
  {% endif %}
  {% if database == 'postgres' %}
  db[(PostgreSQL)]
  api --> db
  {% endif %}
  {% elif kind == 'agent' %}
  user[User]
  agent["{{ project_name }} agent"]
  user --> agent
  {% else %}
  caller[Caller]
  lib["{{ project_name }} library"]
  caller --> lib
  {% endif %}
```
